{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-job-33-1","title":"Job 33:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Elihu offers himself instead of God to reason with Job. 8 He excuses God from giving man an account of his ways, by his greatness. 14 God calls man to repentance by visions, by afflictions, and by his ministry. 31 He incites Job to attention.</p>\n<p>hear. 13:6; 34:2; Ps 49:1-3; Mr 4:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-33-2","title":"Job 33:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>I. 3:1; Ps 78:2; Mt 5:2 mouth. Heb. palate. 31:30; *marg:</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-33-3","title":"Job 33:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>the. 27:4; Pr 8:7,8; 1Th 2:3,4 my lips. 15:2; 36:3,4; 38:2; Ps 37:30,31; Pr 15:2,7; 20:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-33-4","title":"Job 33:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>10:12; 32:8; Ge 2:7; Ps 33:6; Ro 8:2; 1Co 15:45</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-33-5","title":"Job 33:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>If. 32,33; 32:1,12 set. 23:4,5; 32:14; Ps 50:21 stand. Ac 10:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-33-6","title":"Job 33:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>I am. 9:32-35; 13:3; 20:22; 23:3,4; 31:35 wish. Heb. mouth. in. Ge 30:2; Ex 4:16; 2Co 5:20 I also. 4:19; 10:9; 13:12; Ge 2:7; 3:19; 2Co 5:1 formed. Heb. cut.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-33-7","title":"Job 33:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>my terror. 9:34; 13:21; Ps 88:16 my hand. Ps 32:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-33-8","title":"Job 33:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>hearing. Heb. ears. De 13:14; Jer 29:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-33-9","title":"Job 33:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>clean. 9:17; 10:7; 11:4; 16:17; 23:11,12; 27:5,6; 29:14 innocent. 9:23,28; 17:8; Jer 2:35</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-33-10","title":"Job 33:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>he findeth. 9:30,31; 10:15-17; 13:25; 14:16; 34:5 he counteth. 13:24; 16:9; 19:11; 30:21; 31:35</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-33-11","title":"Job 33:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>putteth. 13:27; Ps 105:18; Jer 20:2; Ac 16:24 marketh. 31:4; Da 4:35</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-33-12","title":"Job 33:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>thou. 1:22; 34:10-12,17-19,23; 35:2; 36:22,23; Eze 18:25; Ro 9:19-21 I will. 32:17; 35:4 God. 9:4; 26:14; 36:5; 40:2,8,9; Jer 18:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-33-13","title":"Job 33:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>strive. 9:14; 15:25,26; Isa 45:9; Jer 50:24; Eze 22:14; Ac 5:39; 9:4,5 1Co 10:22 giveth not account. Heb. answereth not. 40:2; De 29:29; Ps 62:11; Isa 46:10; Da 4:35; Mt 20:15; Ac 1:7 Ro 11:34</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-33-14","title":"Job 33:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>God. 40:5; Ps 62:11 perceiveth. 2Ch 33:10; Pr 1:24,29; Isa 6:9; Mt 13:14; Mr 8:17,18; Lu 24:25 Joh 3:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-33-15","title":"Job 33:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>a dream. 4:13; Ge 20:3; 31:24; Nu 12:6; Jer 23:28; Da 4:5; Heb 1:1 deep. Ge 15:12; Da 8:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-33-16","title":"Job 33:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>openeth. Heb. revealeth. or, uncovereth. 36:10,15; 2Sa 7:27; Ps 40:6; Isa 6:10; 48:8; 50:5; Lu 24:45 Ac 16:14 sealeth. Ne 9:38; Ro 15:28</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-33-17","title":"Job 33:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>withdraw. 17:11; Ge 20:6; Isa 23:9; Ho 2:6; Mt 27:19; Ac 9:2-6 purpose. Heb. work. hide. De 8:16; 2Ch 32:25; Isa 2:11; Da 4:30-37; 2Co 12:7; Jas 4:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-33-18","title":"Job 33:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>keepeth. Ac 16:27-33; Ro 2:4; 2Pe 3:9,15 perishing. Heb. passing.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-33-19","title":"Job 33:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>chastened. 5:17,18; De 8:5; Ps 94:12; 119:67,71; Isa 27:9; 1Co 11:32; Re 3:19 pain. 7:4; 20:11; 30:17; 2Ch 16:10,12; Ps 38:1-8; Isa 37:12,13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-33-20","title":"Job 33:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>his life. Ps 107:17,18 dainty meat. Heb. meat of desire. Ge 3:6; Jer 3:19; Am 5:11; *marg:</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-33-21","title":"Job 33:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>His flesh. 7:5; 13:28; 14:20,22; 19:20; Ps 32:3,4; 39:11; 102:3-5; Pr 5:11 his bones. Ps 22:15-17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-33-22","title":"Job 33:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>his soul. 7:7; 17:1,13-16; 1Sa 2:6; Ps 30:3; 88:3-5; Isa 38:10 his life. 15:21; Ex 12:23; 2Sa 24:16; Ps 17:4; Ac 12:23; 1Co 10:10; Re 9:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-33-23","title":"Job 33:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>a messenger. Jud 2:1; 2Ch 36:15,16; Hag 1:13; Mal 2:7; 3:1; 2Co 5:20 an interpreter. 34:32; Ps 94:12; Isa 61:1-3; Ac 8:30; 1Co 11:30-32; Heb 12:5-12 one. 9:3; Ec 7:28; Ro 11:13 to. 11:6; 34:10,12; 35:14; 36:3,8-13; 37:23; Ne 9:33; Ps 119:75 La 3:22,23,32,39-41; Eze 18:25-28; Da 9:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-33-24","title":"Job 33:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>Then. 18; 22:21; Ex 33:19; 34:6,7; Ps 86:5,15; Ho 14:2,4; Mic 7:18-20 Ro 5:20,21 Deliver. 36:10,11; Ps 22:4; 30:9-12; 40:2; 71:3; 86:13; Isa 38:17-19 Jer 31:20; Zec 9:11 I. 33:24; Ps 49:7,8; Mt 20:28; Ro 3:24-26; 1Ti 2:6; 1Pe 1:18,19 a ransom. or, an atonement.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-33-25","title":"Job 33:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>His flesh. 2Ki 5:14 a child's. Heb. childhood. return. 42:16; De 34:7; Jos 14:10,11; Ps 103:5; Ho 2:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-33-26","title":"Job 33:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>pray. 2Ki 20:2-5; 2Ch 33:12,13,19; Ps 6:1-9; 28:1,2,6; 30:7-11; 41:8-11 Ps 50:15; 91:15; 116:1-6; Isa 30:19; Jer 33:3; Jon 2:2-7; Ac 9:11 and he shall. 42:8,9; Nu 6:25,26; Ps 4:6,7; 16:11; 30:5; 67:1; Ac 2:28; Jude 1:24 he will. 34:11; 1Sa 26:23; Ps 18:20; 62:12; Pr 24:12; Mt 10:41,42; Heb 11:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-33-27","title":"Job 33:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>looketh, etc. or, shall look upon men, and say, I havesinned, etc. Ge 16:13; 2Ch 16:9; Ps 11:4; 14:2; 139:1-4; Pr 5:21; 15:3; Jer 23:24 I. 7:20; Nu 12:11; 2Sa 12:13; Pr 28:13; Jer 3:13; 31:18,19 Lu 15:18-22; 18:13; 1Jo 1:8-10 perverted. Ec 5:8 right. Ps 19:7,8; 119:128; Ro 7:12-14,16,22 it profited. 34:9; Jer 2:8; Mt 16:26; Ro 6:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-33-28","title":"Job 33:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>will deliver, etc. or, hath delivered my soul, etc. and mylife. 18,24; 17:16; Ps 55:23; 69:15; Isa 38:17,18; Re 20:1-3 see. 20,22; 3:9,16,20; Ps 49:19; Isa 9:2; Joh 11:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-33-29","title":"Job 33:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>all. 14-17; 1Co 12:6; 2Co 5:5; Eph 1:11; Php 2:13; Col 1:29; Heb 13:21 oftentimes. Heb. twice and thrice. 14; 40:5; 2Ki 6:10; 2Co 12:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-33-30","title":"Job 33:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>To bring. 24,28; Ps 40:1,2; 118:17,18 enlightened. Ps 56:13; Isa 2:5; 38:17; Joh 8:12; Ac 26:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-33-31","title":"Job 33:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>13:6; 18:2; 21:2; 32:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-33-32","title":"Job 33:32","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":32,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":32},"content":"<p>15:4,5; 21:27; 22:5-9; 27:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-job-33-33","title":"Job 33:33","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JOB","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":33,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":33},"content":"<p>hearken. Ps 34:11; Pr 4:1,2; 5:1,2 I. 3; Ps 49:3; Pr 8:5</p>"}]}